<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GGUNDLE PLANS 25.6 MLN RAND RIGHTS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>GGUNDLE PLANS 25.6 MLN RAND RIGHTS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging and print firm Gundle Ltd said on Wednesday it planned a 25.6 million rand rights offer of 5.1 million new shares at an issue price of five rand each.</p>
<p>Last day to register for the offer is April 11.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
